<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;Write the user-facing reply after the latest specification refinement. Keep it concise and grounded in the current project truth.&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
